# Praman SAP Test Automation

**Primary skill reference**: `node_modules/playwright-praman/skills/playwright-praman-sap-testing/SKILL.md`

Read this file before generating any SAP UI5 test.

## Mandatory Import

```typescript
import { test, expect } from 'playwright-praman';
```

## Core Rules

1. ALL UI5 element interaction via `ui5.control()` + proxy methods
2. NEVER `page.click('#__...')`, `page.locator('[data-sap-ui]')`, `page.locator('.sapM...')`
3. Input pattern: `setValue()` + `fireChange()` + `waitForUI5()` always together
4. Auth in seed file ONLY — never in test body
5. Include TSDoc compliance header in every generated test

